# The Borg Queen (cast on turn 1 off two Black Lotuses, a Mox Jet and a Mox Pearl) gives artifact creatures its
# controller has +2/+2 - its own 4/4 is a 6/6 and an Ornithopter is a 2/4 - while Bot2's own Ornithopter stays 0/2.
# Its entry trigger targets an opponent - a third seat forces the choice (Bot1 itself and a permanent are no targets at
# all, CR 115.1) - and the targeted opponent exiles
# Islands, a Swamp, a Forest and a Mountain until a Grizzly Bears: the Bears is assimilated as a Borg artifact creature
# with a +1/+1 counter (5/5 here, CR 205.1b, 614.12) and the six other exiled cards go to the bottom, so nothing is
# left in exile and Bot2's library is the same size but for the assimilated Bears, which left it (CR 401.4, 701.13a).

